# ========================================
# CONTRACT ADDRESSES
# ========================================
# Addresses are NOT stored here. Every one is read from the deployment JSON the deploy script
# writes, so a stale address cannot be picked up from an env file:
#
#   contracts/deployments/31337-v2.json    the v2 stack (make up)
#   contracts/deployments/31337-dex.json   the permissioned pool (make dex-up)
#
# `make cli ARGS=status` prints what the chain currently holds.
#
# WHAT WAS HERE BEFORE, and why it is gone: two CIRCUIT_WASM_PATH/PROVING_KEY_PATH variables
# naming a `main` circuit that no longer exists and that nothing read, a get-address.sh helper
# that is not in this tree, two deployment files this stack does not write, and a contract list
# from an earlier iteration. All of it was followed by nobody and contradicted by everything.
# ========================================
